    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">薬草 Herbal %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_what_it_is">A small book of herbs for tea: who should not take each one, what it is traditionally used for and what the research says, and how to make it. It works without a connection.</string>
    <string name="about_safety_heading">Not medical advice</string>
    <string name="safety_disclaimer">This app is a reference book, not medical advice. It cannot tell you that an herb is safe for you. Herbs can interact with medicines and can harm some people, in pregnancy and nursing especially. If you take any medicine, are pregnant or nursing, or are unwell, ask your doctor, midwife or pharmacist first. See a doctor for anything serious or lasting.</string>
    <string name="about_sources_heading">Sources</string>
    <string name="about_sources">The cautions and the research lines are written from the US National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health\'s Herbs at a Glance pages (nccih.nih.gov) and, where it has no page, from the National Institutes of Health\'s LiverTox and LactMed and the US Food and Drug Administration. These are works of the US government and in the public domain; the wording in this app is its own. Where they are silent, some traditional uses draw on Wikipedia articles (CC BY-SA 4.0), and a few pregnancy and nursing notes on open-access journal articles (CC BY), each credited on its herb\'s page. Each herb\'s page lists its sources. The herb text is still a draft.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_heading">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Nothing you do in the app leaves this phone. Your journal, your cupboard and your own timer settings are kept on the phone, and a copy goes only where you save one. The app has no internet permission and cannot go online. \"Feed the llamas\" in About, and a source\'s address on an herb page, open in your browser only when you press them.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_close">There are no ads, no analytics and no tracking.</string>
    <string name="about_terms_heading">Terms</string>
    <string name="about_terms_licence">This app is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 only. It comes with no warranty: use it at your own risk.</string>
    <string name="about_terms">This book is information, not advice. You decide, and you are responsible for what you do with it. A donation through \"Feed the llamas\" is voluntary and unlocks nothing: the app is the same with or without one.</string>
    <string name="about_feed_the_llamas">Feed the llamas</string>
